---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import PageHero from '../components/PageHero.astro';
import { site } from '../data/site';

// TODO: have this reviewed before launch, and update it when Google Forms,
// Google Calendar booking or analytics are added.
const updated = '28 October 2026';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Privacy Notice"
  description="How Brandmaxxing collects, uses and protects your personal information in line with POPIA."
>
  <PageHero eyebrow="Privacy" title="Privacy notice" intro={`Last updated ${updated}.`} />

  <section class="section">
    <div class="container prose">
      <p>
        {site.name} respects your privacy. This notice explains what personal information we collect through this website,
        why we collect it and how we look after it, in line with South Africa’s Protection of Personal Information Act
        (POPIA).
      </p>

      <h2>What we collect</h2>
      <p>
        We only collect information you choose to give us, for example when you send an enquiry or request a consultation.
        This may include your name, business name, email address, phone number and details about your business and marketing
        goals.
      </p>

      <h2>How we use it</h2>
      <p>We use your information to:</p>
      <ul>
        <li>reply to your enquiry or consultation request;</li>
        <li>prepare for and hold a consultation with you;</li>
        <li>provide services if you become a client.</li>
      </ul>
      <p>We don’t sell your information, and we don’t add you to marketing lists without your permission.</p>

      <h2>Third-party services</h2>
      <p>
        This website is hosted on GitHub Pages. Enquiries and bookings may be handled through email and Google services
        (such as Google Forms and Google Calendar), which store information on our behalf under their own privacy terms.
      </p>

      <h2>How long we keep it</h2>
      <p>
        We keep your information only for as long as we need it for the purposes above, or as required by law. After that we
        delete it securely.
      </p>

      <h2>Your rights</h2>
      <p>
        You can ask to see the personal information we hold about you, ask us to correct or delete it, or object to how we
        use it. You also have the right to lodge a complaint with the Information Regulator of South Africa.
      </p>

      <h2>Contact us</h2>
      <p>
        For any privacy question or request, email <a href={`mailto:${site.contact.email}`}>{site.contact.email}</a>.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .prose {
    max-width: 46rem;
  }

  .prose h2 {
    margin-top: 2.75rem;
    margin-bottom: 0.9rem;
    font-size: var(--step-2);
  }

  .prose p,
  .prose li {
    color: var(--muted);
  }

  .prose p + p,
  .prose ul + p {
    margin-top: 1rem;
  }

  .prose ul {
    margin-top: 0.75rem;
    padding-left: 1.25rem;
    display: grid;
    gap: 0.35rem;
  }

  .prose li::marker {
    color: var(--accent);
  }

  .prose a {
    color: var(--accent);
  }
</style>
